  portalList:
  - portalType: 1
    areaName: Red Sand Canyon
    areaDescription: High-speed flight training zone. Howling winds and severe sandstorms
      will reduce your visibility. Master your altitude control and get familiar
      with the aircraft's handling.
    unlockCondition: Unlock
  - portalType: 0
    areaName: Eternal Peaks
    areaDescription: A brutal, unforgiving blizzard track. Sub-zero temperatures
      will affect your engine's performance. Watch out for sudden ice cliffs and
      narrow frozen passes!
    unlockCondition: Complete Red Sand Canyon with Rank B or higher.
  - portalType: 2
    areaName: Zeta Complex
    areaDescription: 'A heavily fortified outpost patrolled by automated security
      drones. Objective: Infiltrate the perimeter, bypass the alarm systems, and
      retrieve the Memory Stone. Stay out of their line of sight.'
    unlockCondition: Collect 2 Stone Memory
